One-Line Interview Cheat Sheet

Keyword	Easy Meaning
LLM	AI brain that understands and generates text
Prompt	Instruction given to AI
Prompt Engineering	Writing better instructions
Token	Small text pieces AI processes
Context Window	AI’s working memory
Temperature	Controls creativity
Embedding	Numeric representation of meaning
Vector	List of numbers representing text
Vector Database	Stores embeddings for semantic search
Similarity Search	Finds similar meanings, not exact words
Chunking	Splitting large documents into smaller pieces
RAG	Retrieve information first, then generate an answer
Retriever	Finds relevant document chunks
Generator	LLM that writes the final answer
Hallucination	AI confidently gives incorrect information
Grounding	Answering using trusted source documents
Fine-Tuning	Retraining the model for a specific behavior
LangChain	Framework that orchestrates GenAI workflows
Agent	AI that can plan and perform actions
Tool	External resource the AI can use
Guardrails	Safety and security controls
Azure OpenAI	Enterprise access to OpenAI models on Azure

